<p>Boli zainab chali kahaa'n amma<br />
Chord ko hum ko neemjaa'n amma</p>

<p>Bhai shabbar pachaadei'n kha kha kar<br />
Poochte hai gayi kahaa'n amma</p>

<p>Bhai sarwar ka dam na ghut jaaye<br />
Kab se karte hai wo fughaa'n amma</p>

<p>Aaj bin maa ki ho gayi'n afsos<br />
Teri dukhiyaari betiyaa'n amma</p>

<p>Saath apne hamei'n bhi le chaliye<br />
Aap jaati hai ab jahaa'n amma</p>

<p>Uth gaya sar se aap ka saaya<br />
Log ab denge ghurkiyaa'n amma</p>

<p>Bhooliyega na isko mehshar <br />
Hai sa'eed apna nouhakhwaa'n amma<br />
</p>